{"id":"8a3cbbd03d905ffa","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-shepherdson-representation.md","title":"Shepherdson’s Self-Reference Representation Lemma","display":"lem-shepherdson-representation — Shepherdson’s Self-Reference Representation Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-shepherdson-representation","aliases":["92-lem-shepherdson-representation"],"display":"lem-shepherdson-representation — Shepherdson’s Self-Reference Representation Lemma","source":"第 VII 章 p. 88，Lemma 1 与 Lemma 1*（PDF 105）；本地实例重构","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]]","[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-weak-separation]]","[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-shepherdson-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-shepherdson-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-shepherdson-representation — Shepherdson’s Self-Reference Representation Lemma"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 p. 88，Lemma 1 与 Lemma 1*（PDF 105）；本地实例重构"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"31cbbeaa392f6458\" href=\"?note=31cbbeaa392f6458\" title=\"92-df-local-binary-instance-code\">92-df-local-binary-instance-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"323282b93f22ef06\" href=\"?note=323282b93f22ef06\" title=\"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system\">92-df-effective-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"00f528e893a47b3f\" href=\"?note=00f528e893a47b3f\" title=\"92-df-weak-separation\">92-df-weak-separation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9758d74f9a5e939a\" href=\"?note=9758d74f9a5e939a\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-representability\">92-df-smullyan-representability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=\\ulcorner F\\urcorner\">\\(h=\\ulcorner F\\urcorner\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,\\bar h)\">\\(H=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,\\bar h)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A,\\ \\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\notin P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}\">\\(C=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A,\\ \\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\notin P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\{(x,y)\\mid\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#},\\ x\\notin A\\}\">\\(D=\\{(x,y)\\mid\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#},\\ x\\notin A\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^2,\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^2,\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1\\)</span> 为弱分离与原书普通表示关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^2(F;C,D)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(H,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^2(F;C,D)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(H,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_n\">\\(q_n\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar h)\">\\(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar h)\\)</span>。由实例码定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_n\\leftrightarrow\\Pi_G(h,n,h)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\">\\(q_n\\leftrightarrow\\Pi_G(h,n,h)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\)</span>。弱分离给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n\\in A\\land\\neg q_n)\\Rightarrow q_n\">\\((n\\in A\\land\\neg q_n)\\Rightarrow q_n\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q_n\\land n\\notin A)\\Rightarrow\\neg q_n\">\\((q_n\\land n\\notin A)\\Rightarrow\\neg q_n\\)</span>，经典元逻辑因此给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_n\\leftrightarrow n\\in A\">\\(q_n\\leftrightarrow n\\in A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(H;\\bar n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(H;\\bar n)\\)</span> 与上述同时实例逻辑等价；即使确定性改名给不同字符码，经典演算仍证明二者等价，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。本引理不要求一致性、有效性或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为 c.e.；这些只用于后续产生弱分离见证。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 p. 88，Lemma 1 与 Lemma 1*（PDF 105）；本地实例重构。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-local-binary-instance-code","status":"resolved","id":"31cbbeaa392f6458","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"323282b93f22ef06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-weak-separation","status":"resolved","id":"00f528e893a47b3f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-weak-separation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-representability","status":"resolved","id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h=\\ulcorner F\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"H=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,\\bar h)","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A,\\ \\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\notin P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\{(x,y)\\mid\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#},\\ x\\notin A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^2,\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^2(F;C,D)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(H,A).","display":true},{"tex":"q_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar h)","display":false},{"tex":"q_n\\leftrightarrow\\Pi_G(h,n,h)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}","display":false},{"tex":"(n\\in A\\land\\neg q_n)\\Rightarrow q_n","display":false},{"tex":"(q_n\\land n\\notin A)\\Rightarrow\\neg q_n","display":false},{"tex":"q_n\\leftrightarrow n\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(H;\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2033,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-l